 Column |  Type   | Key? | Definition 
--------+---------+------+------------
 a      | integer | yes  | a
primary key, btree, for table "public.t", implemented by test_btree_impl

\d t
                 Table "public.t"
 Column |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default 
--------+---------+-----------+----------+---------
 a      | integer |           | not null | 
 b      | text    |           |          | 
 c      | integer |           |          | 
Indexes:
    "t_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (a)
    "t_a" btree (a)
    "t_ab" btree (a, b)
    "t_b_hash" hash (b)
    "t_c" UNIQUE, btree (c) INCLUDE (b)

